      "description": "Stepped amber action shared by entry and deduction submission.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">START GAME <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" shape-rendering=\"crispEdges\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M3 10h12V7h-3V4h4v3h3v3h3v4h-3v3h-3v3h-4v-3h3v-3H3z\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:28px;min-height:54px;border:0;border-radius:0;padding:18px 22px;background:var(--gold);color:#18252a;font:10px/1.5 \"Press Start 2P\",monospace;box-shadow:inset 0 4px #ffe6a3,inset 0 -4px #a9723e;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary:before,.ds-primary:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:4px;top:4px;bottom:4px;background:inherit}.ds-primary:before{left:-4px}.ds-primary:after{right:-4px}.ds-primary svg{width:18px;height:18px}.ds-primary:hover{background:#ffe1a0}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-primary:active{transform:translateY(2px);box-shadow:inset 0 4px #a9723e,inset 0 -2px #ffe6a3}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default;transform:none}"
